# API Error Contracts

- Standardize 4xx and 5xx API failures around Problem JSON style fields: type, title, status, detail, instance.
- Include stable machine-readable error codes where the API already exposes them.
- Do not leak stack traces, secrets, SQL details, or internal infrastructure identifiers in responses.
- Include correlation or request identifiers in server-side logs and expose them in safe error metadata when supported.
- Keep success and error shapes consistent within the same API surface.
